{# T.N.S.V.T - Google Fonts (canonical loader, used by both shell.html.twig and public/shell.html.twig)
   Families:
     - Cinzel          : display, hero titles (via --font-display)
     - Orbitron        : labels, eyebrows, tags (via --font-label)
     - Space Grotesk   : monospace numerics, body (via --font-mono)
     - Inter           : body, paragraphs (via --font-body)
     - Material Symbols: icons
   If you need a font in a template, add it HERE, not in shell.html.twig. #}
